# review/19-distinct-storage-protocols
profile own
scope.begin outer
new o O
bind outer_bind o
storage atomic atomic
storage.set atomic value o
scope.begin inner
new i I
bind inner_bind i
storage.set atomic value i
scope.end inner
check I
storage.close atomic
storage channel channel
new message M
storage.set channel first message
scope.begin receiver
storage.get delivered channel first
use delivered
scope.end receiver
check IM
use o
scope.end outer
